MVP goal: post-processing drumming technique analysis, not real-time coaching.
End-to-end workflow: auth → select exercise → record/upload video → create Firestore job → Cloud Run analyzes → app renders results.
Scope boundaries: single drummer, controlled setup, short 15–30 second clips, single strokes/double strokes/paradiddles.
Architecture:
React Native app in kiroheroes
Firebase Auth, Firestore, Storage
Python FastAPI Cloud Run service
Old repo reuse policy:
Reuse app shell, auth context, theme/responsive hooks, Firebase service pattern, media picker/upload pattern, TanStack Query setup.
Remove maps, location/accessibility domain logic, live YOLO detection, model artifacts, and unrelated screens.
MVP success criteria and non-goals.
